        "kind": "live",
        "title": "The same payment sent again after it has settled",
      },
    ],
    "title": "One payment, one delivery, even under a burst",
    "version": 1,
    "whatItTests": "Whether one signed payment can unlock your paid content more than once, when copies arrive together or later.",
